              "text": "Dogs homozygous for the ABCB1-1∆ gene deletion also affected; heterozygous dogs can react at higher doses. The ABCB1-1∆ gene mutation has been found in Shetland sheepdogs, Australian shepherds, Old English sheepdogs, German shepherds, English shepherds, longhaired whippets, silken windhounds, and a variety of mixed-breed dogs.",
